00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.660
Sam even made us an intro for it.
山姆甚至还为它做了个开场白。

157
00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:34.780
It was a cold and rainy night when someone dropped that package through my mailbox.
那是一个寒冷多雨的夜晚，有人把那个包裹投进了我的信箱。

158
00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:36.660
So many clues.
线索太多了。

159
00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:37.720
So much chaos.
太混乱了。

160
00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.180
It had been a long time since I saw this big of a mess.
我已经很久没见过这么大的烂摊子了。

161
00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.520
But because it wasn't a far drive.
但因为路程不远。

162
00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.400
And because it wasn't a school night.
而且那天不是上学日。

163
00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.100
And because there was only a little bit of evidence so it could fit in a small amount of pockets.
而且证据很少，刚好能装进小口袋里。

164
00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.440
And because I had snacks in case they got hungry.
而且我准备了零食，以防他们饿了。

165
00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.340
And because it wasn't chilly out.
而且外面也不冷。

166
00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.700
God help me, I knew who I needed to call.
上帝保佑，我知道我该找谁了。

167
00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:08.320
The mom detectives.
妈妈侦探们。

168
00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:12.090
I love it so much.
我太喜欢这个了。

169
00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.860
A piece of that makes me laugh, Sam.
其中一段让我笑个不停，山姆。

170
00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.720
I love that it starts in a thunderstorm.
我喜欢它以雷雨天开场。

171
00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:23.380
I love the small amount of evidence that can fit into tiny pockets.
我喜欢那些能装进小口袋里的少量证据。

172
00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.120
And because we have snacks.
而且因为我们有零食。

173
00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.480
There were restrooms nearby.
附近还有洗手间。

174
00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:27.920
Oh, yes.
噢，没错。

175
00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.660
Well, here it is, folks.
好了，各位，就是这个。

176
00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:34.700
I reached out to James Carey and writer Justin Spitzer.
我联系了詹姆斯·凯瑞和编剧贾斯汀·斯皮策。

177
00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:41.780
And I dug into my digital clutter and I found an email from Randy Cordray that said,
我翻了翻我的数字杂物，找到了一封兰迪·科德雷的邮件，上面写着：

178
00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:47.740
Team office, it is looking like we need to shoot some additional material for shareholder meeting.
办公室团队，看起来我们需要为股东大会补拍一些素材。

179
00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.060
Additional material.
补拍素材。

180
00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.020
What does that mean?
那是什么意思？

181
00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.100
I said, Jenna, I found an email.
我说，珍娜，我找到了一封邮件。

182
00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.780
I quickly texted her.
我赶紧给她发了短信。

183
00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.400
Randy goes on to say,
兰迪接着说：

184
00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:59.000
We are planning these scenes for Monday, October 19th.
我们计划在10月19日星期一拍摄这些场景。

185
00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.860
Webisodes will be moving to Tuesday, October 20th.
网络剧集将移至10月20日星期二拍摄。

186
00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.500
Thank you, Randy Cordray.
谢谢你，兰迪·科德雷。

187
00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:05.640
Hmm.
嗯。

188
00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:06.600
Hmm.
嗯。

189
00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:11.360
Well, Jenna, this was a big deal because we were supposed to go on hiatus.
好吧，珍娜，这可是件大事，因为我们本该进入休假期的。

190
00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:12.700
Yes.
是的。

191
00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:13.280
Right?
对吧？

192
00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.160
We had this big, long hiatus starting October 19th.
我们从10月19日开始有一个很长的假期。

193
00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.800
All the way until after the new year.
一直持续到新年之后。

194
00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.660
A few of us were going to work on the webisodes,
我们中有几个人要去拍网络剧集，

195
00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.600
but the majority of the company was officially on hiatus.
但公司的大多数人正式进入了休假期。

196
00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.680
So Randy was basically saying like,
所以兰迪基本上是在说：

197
00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.020
Don't go out of town.
别出远门。

198
00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.080
We might need you.
我们可能需要你们。

199
00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:28.960
Yes.
是的。

200
00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:33.820
I found out that Steve was scheduled to shoot the movie Dinner for Schmucks.
我发现史蒂夫当时被安排去拍摄电影《笨人晚宴》。

201
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.500
So we were shutting down production early that year.
所以那年我们提前结束了制作。

202
00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:42.080
I spoke to James Carey, who uncovered the call sheet schedule for shareholder meeting.
我联系了詹姆斯·凯里，他找到了股东大会的拍摄通告单。

203
00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.920
And it's true.
事实确实如此。

204
00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.920
We shot most of this episode the week of September 28th,
这一集大部分内容是在9月28日那一周拍摄的，

205
00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:54.200
but we did not shoot the Jim Ryan scenes until Friday, October 16th.
但吉姆·瑞安的戏份直到10月16日星期五才拍。

206
00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:55.880
I had to know why.
我必须弄清楚原因。

207
00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.160
The plot thickens.
事情变得扑朔迷离了。

208
00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:01.840
Writer Justin Spitzer told me that the Jim Ryan storyline
编剧贾斯汀·斯皮策告诉我，吉姆·瑞安的故事线

209
00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:06.040
was a part of his original outline for this episode,
是他这一集最初大纲的一部分，

210
00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:11.460
but it was eventually cut from the shooting draft in favor of staying at the hotel
但最终为了留在酒店拍摄更多股东大会的戏份，

211
00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.280
for more scenes of the shareholder meeting.
这段内容被从拍摄剧本中删掉了。

212
00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:19.080
So that plot, that Jim Ryan plot, was then shortened
所以那个吉姆·瑞安的故事线被缩短了，

213
00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:23.740
and repurposed as a cold open for Scott's Tots.
并被重新利用作为《斯科特的托儿们》的开场戏。

214
00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:24.480
What?
什么？

215
00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:28.460
We actually shot it during Scott's Tots.
我们实际上是在拍《斯科特的托儿们》时拍的这段。

216
00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:35.340
But then it was cut from Scott's Tots, and it was rewritten again,
但后来它又从《斯科特的托儿们》里被删掉了，又经过了重写，

217
00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:39.940
and we added that shoot day, and it went back into shareholder meeting.
我们增加了那个拍摄日，它又回到了股东大会那一集里。

218
00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:44.040
So Justin said that when they were editing shareholder meeting,
贾斯汀说，当他们在剪辑股东大会那一集时，

219
00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:48.880
they just missed not checking in on the group back at Dunder Mifflin.
他们就是觉得少了点邓德·米夫林办公室里大家的情况。

220
00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:55.040
He also said that in all of these iterations of the Jim Ryan storyline,
他还说，在吉姆·瑞安故事线的所有这些版本中，

221
00:10:55.040 --> 00:11:00.100
the one thing that always happened was that Ryan ended up in a closet.
唯一不变的就是瑞安最后总是会待在壁橱里。

222
00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:05.380
And the reason for this was that they wanted to get BJ out of the background
原因在于他们想让BJ（诺瓦克）避开

223
00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:08.020
of scenes that were happening in the bullpen.
办公区背景里的戏份。

224
00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:09.320
Sneaky.
真狡猾。

225
00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.160
Yes.
没错。

226
00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:17.280
So that scene that we saw, Angela, that's in the annex with Ryan playing Tetris?
所以我们看到的那个安吉拉和瑞安在附楼里玩俄罗斯方块的场景？

227
00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:17.740
Yeah.
对。

228
00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:21.780
That was actually shot during Scott's Tots.
那其实是在拍《斯科特的托儿们》时拍的。

229
00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:25.680
That is the one scene from that cold open that remained.
那是那个开场戏中唯一保留下来的镜头。

230
00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:32.600
And then we added all of this other stuff about people not taking Jim seriously,
然后我们增加了所有关于大家不把吉姆当回事的内容，

231
00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:33.920
and we fleshed it out.
并把它充实了起来。

232
00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.100
Well, this was clearly a puzzle, but we haven't figured it out yet.
好吧，这显然是个谜题，但我们还没完全解开。

233
00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:42.080
We are still wondering about these four gift bags on Kelly's desk.
我们还在纳闷凯莉桌上的那四个礼品袋是怎么回事。

234
00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:45.460
I was curious which webisode we were shooting that week,
我很好奇那一周我们在拍哪部网络剧，

235
00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:48.740
so I reached out to Randy, and he said it was The Mentor.
所以我联系了兰迪，他说那是《导师》。

236
00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:53.740
In this webisode series, Erin decides she wants to learn to be an accountant.
在这个网络剧系列中，艾琳决定她想学做会计。

237
00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.020
I rewatched it, and here's how it's set up.
我重看了一遍，剧情是这样设定的。

238
00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.240
Sometimes I do get bored at reception,
有时候我在前台确实会觉得无聊，

239
00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:03.140
and I wonder what it's like to be an accountant.
我很好奇做会计是什么感觉。

240
00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.000
So I guess what I'm saying is I really want your life,
所以我猜我想说的是，我真的很想要你的生活，

241
00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:07.020
and I don't know how to get it.
但我不知道该怎么得到。

242
00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:08.140
Are you good with numbers?
你擅长数字吗？

243
00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.160
The count used to be my favorite part of Sesame Street.
“伯爵”曾经是我在《芝麻街》里最喜欢的角色。

244
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.060
One apple, two apples, three apples.
一个苹果，两个苹果，三个苹果。

245
00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.500
Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah.
啊，啊，啊，啊，啊。

246
00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.500
Yeah.
是啊。

247
00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:21.940
Maybe it's not for you.
也许这不适合你。

248
00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.560
I could be your mentor.
我可以做你的导师。

249
00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:29.640
Okay.
好的。

250
00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:30.660
Yeah, I can do it.
好，我可以做到。

251
00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.860
I have to do everything else around here, so.
这里其他所有事都得我来做，所以。

252
00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:33.880
Really?
真的吗？

253
00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:34.620
Yes.
是的。

254
00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:35.240
Great!
太棒了！

255
00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:38.060
Oh!
噢！

256
00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:39.020
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

257
00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:45.040
This whole webisode series is Angela Martin teaching Erin how to be an accountant and grooming her.
这一整套网络剧系列讲的是安吉拉·马丁教艾琳如何做会计，并培养她。

258
00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:46.500
How does that go?
进展如何？

259
00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.220
We actually had so much fun.
我们其实玩得很开心。

260
00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:53.640
Of course, it doesn't turn out the way Angela hoped, but it was a blast to shoot.
当然，结果并没有像安吉拉希望的那样，但拍摄过程非常愉快。

261
00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.180
Randy also shared the call sheet with me.
兰迪还和我分享了通告单。

262
00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:59.560
We filmed the webisode on Monday, October 19th.
我们是在10月19日星期一拍摄的那集网络剧。

263
00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.660
Here were two fun details on the call sheet that day.
那天通告单上有两个有趣的细节。

264
00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:03.960
Quote,
引用如下：

265
00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.540
Today, Monday, Scare-tober 19th.
今天，10月19日，惊魂十月（Scare-tober）。

266
00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:18.020
Today is the second annual Michael Scott Dunder Mifflin Scranton Office Memorial Cast and Crew Fun Halloween Costume Contest for the Doldrum's Cure.
今天是第二届年度迈克尔·斯科特邓德·米福林斯克兰顿分公司纪念演职人员趣味万圣节服装大赛，旨在治愈无聊。

267
00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:18.840
Yes!
没错！

268
00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:22.980
That's because we were not going to be shooting over Halloween that year.
那是因为我们那年不会在万圣节期间拍摄。

269
00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:25.340
We had to move up our Halloween parade.
我们不得不提前举行万圣节游行。

270
00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.440
Yes, our costume parade at work.
没错，就是我们在办公室的服装游行。

271
00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.020
It also said, quote,
上面还写着，引用如下：

272
00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.800
Well, this explained another email from my digital clutter.
好吧，这解释了我数字杂物里的另一封邮件。

273
00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:41.220
I had found an email from Joya Balfour, who worked for NBC.com,
我发现了一封来自乔亚·巴尔福的邮件，她在NBC.com工作，

274
00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:47.500
saying she was coming to set with a bunch of bobbleheads for me to feature in one of my Adventures with Angela segments for NBC.
她说她要带一堆摇头娃娃到片场，让我为NBC的《安吉拉历险记》节目做个专题。

275
00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:53.480
She even shared with me a mock-up poster for the sale of the bobbleheads that were going to go online.
她甚至还给我看了即将上线销售的摇头娃娃的海报草图。

276
00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:54.980
I'll put that in our stories.
我会把它发到我们的故事里。

277
00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:57.360
But here's the thing I was curious about.
但这里有个让我好奇的地方。

278
00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.000
She ended her email by saying, quote,
她在邮件结尾说，引用如下：

279
00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.440
Has Mindy played her new webisode song track for you?
敏迪给你听过她那首新的网络剧歌曲了吗？

280
00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:08.140
If not, go bug her, because it's amazing.
如果没有，快去缠着她，因为那首歌太棒了。

281
00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.260
I've been humming it all weekend.
我整个周末都在哼这首歌。

282
00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:15.800
Well, now that got me curious about what song she was talking about, so I looked it up.
好吧，这让我对她说的歌产生了好奇，所以我查了一下。

283
00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:21.000
And Subtle Sexuality, the webisode series, was about to air on October 29th.
而《微妙的性取向》这部网络剧系列即将在10月29日播出。

284
00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.500
And Joya had seen an early edit of it.
乔亚看过它的早期剪辑版。

285
00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.740
So I went to rewatch that.
所以我回去重看了那部剧。

286
00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.220
Jenna, Joya was right.
珍娜，乔亚说得对。

287
00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.640
The song is so good.
这首歌太好听了。

288
00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:31.040
Just listen to the chorus.
听听副歌就知道了。

289
00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.280
I can't get it out of my head.
我脑子里一直挥之不去。

290
00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:55.370
Wait, is that an original song and Mindy is singing it?
等等，那是原创歌曲吗？是敏迪唱的？

291
00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:55.870
Yes.
是的。

292
00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.670
Stop it.
别开玩笑了。

293
00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.830
Isn't that so good?
是不是很好听？

294
00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.730
Why is she not outperforming that at clubs all the time?
她为什么不一直去夜店表演这首歌？

295
00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:03.770
That is so catchy.
这歌太洗脑了。

296
00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.890
It is really a fun song.
这确实是一首很有趣的歌。

297
00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:10.810
And both of those webisodes were so great, but they still didn't explain the GIFs.
这两集网络剧都很棒，但它们还是没能解释那些GIF动图的事。

298
00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:12.410
Yeah.
是啊。

299
00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:15.290
Were they in any of the deleted scenes?
它们出现在删减片段里了吗？

300
00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.930
I saw no GIF bags in any deleted scenes.
我在任何删减片段里都没看到GIF相关的包。

301
00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:20.550
I still don't know why Kelly has them on her desk.
我还是不知道为什么凯莉的桌上有那些东西。

302
00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:25.410
I even read the shooting draft for Scott's Tots because the scene came from that episode.
我甚至读了《斯科特的托特》的拍摄剧本，因为那个场景出自那一集。

303
00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.770
And there is nothing in that episode about Kelly and GIF bags.
但那一集里根本没提凯莉和GIF袋子的事。

304
00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:33.930
Well, a few folks also caught this, and there is a fan theory online about it.
嗯，也有几个人注意到了这一点，网上还有一个相关的粉丝理论。

305
00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:39.210
You slash Stolatron21 posted this theory on Reddit.
用户Stolatron21在Reddit上发布了这个理论。

306
00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.170
And Jenna, it kind of makes sense.
而且珍娜，这听起来还挺有道理的。

