And in this case, they really did break down, in some cases, what Recyclops should look like.
在这种情况下，他们确实在某些方面详细拆解了“回收怪人”应该是什么样子。

461
00:23:17.150 --> 00:23:25.470
So, for example, for the very first Recyclops, in the script, it said, Earth Day 2005.
比如，对于最初的“回收怪人”，剧本里写的是：2005年地球日。

462
00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:34.450
Dwight is wearing a Think Green t-shirt, a bandana over his mouth, and a third eye on his forehead while lecturing everyone on recycling.
德怀特穿着一件“拥抱绿色”的T恤，嘴上戴着头巾，额头上长着第三只眼，同时向大家宣讲回收利用。

463
00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:45.150
So, Alicia told me that her first concern was that that description reminded her a little bit of this character called Greenzo from 30 Rock, who was played by David Schwimmer.
所以，艾丽西亚告诉我，她最初担心的是，这个描述让她想起了《我为喜剧狂》里的一个叫格林佐的角色，由大卫·休默饰演。

464
00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:48.330
Greenzo was 30 Rocks.
格林佐是《我为喜剧狂》里的角色。

465
00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:49.770
Recyclops?
“回收怪人”？

466
00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:50.830
Yeah, kind of.
对，差不多吧。

467
00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:52.970
He was this environmental activiSt.
他是个环保活动家。

468
00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:54.870
He wore, like, a green shirt.
他穿了一件绿色的衬衫。

469
00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:56.370
He wore a green baseball cap.
他戴了一顶绿色的棒球帽。

470
00:23:57.310 --> 00:24:03.610
So, when she was sketching out Dwight's first costume, she wanted to make sure no one was going to think this was Greenzo.
所以，当她为德怀特设计第一套服装时，她想确保没人会觉得这是格林佐。

471
00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:06.770
So, then the script said, Earth Day 2006.
然后剧本写的是：2006年地球日。

472
00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:16.870
Dwight is wearing a Love Earth t-shirt, a cape, wrist guards, elbow pads, knee pads, moon boots, a full motorcycle helmet,
德怀特穿着一件“热爱地球”的T恤，披着斗篷，戴着护腕、护肘、护膝、月球靴，戴着全罩式摩托车头盔，

473
00:24:17.130 --> 00:24:23.310
and a larger eye in the middle of his forehead as he lectures everyone in the office.
额头中间还有一只更大的眼睛，他在办公室里向大家宣讲。

474
00:24:23.710 --> 00:24:27.050
And in Alicia's notes, she wrote this, which I found hilarious.
在艾丽西亚的笔记里，她写了这段话，我觉得太搞笑了。

475
00:24:27.450 --> 00:24:28.310
She wrote, quote,
她写道，引用：

476
00:24:28.310 --> 00:24:32.670
I don't think this has anything to do with Earth Day anymore for Dwight.
“我觉得这对于德怀特来说已经和地球日没什么关系了。”

477
00:24:33.470 --> 00:24:39.050
So, like, she's like, the costume needs to reflect that.
所以，她的意思是，服装需要反映出这一点。

478
00:24:39.470 --> 00:24:41.530
But then the script got really vague.
但后来剧本变得非常模糊。

479
00:24:41.850 --> 00:24:48.070
The next two for September 2006 and February 2007, they just say,
接下来的两套，分别是2006年9月和2007年2月的，剧本只写了：

480
00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:53.470
Dwight is in a much more serious costume, or the costume is more elaborate.
“德怀特穿了一套更严肃的服装”，或者“服装更复杂”。

481
00:24:53.830 --> 00:24:56.790
And so, she just really had to start making things up.
所以，她真的只能开始自己编了。

482
00:24:56.790 --> 00:24:57.830
She really did.
她确实是这样做的。

483
00:24:58.030 --> 00:25:02.230
But the present-day Recyclops was scripted like this.
但现在的“回收怪人”剧本是这样写的：

484
00:25:02.470 --> 00:25:06.770
He wears heavy green body armor, which makes it difficult to walk.
他穿着厚重的绿色防弹衣，走起路来很困难。

485
00:25:06.950 --> 00:25:10.390
There is a blinking LED display on his cheSt.
他的胸前有一个闪烁的LED显示屏。

486
00:25:10.590 --> 00:25:14.850
He has aerosol cans taped to his hands, which spray a red miSt.
他的手上粘着气雾罐，会喷出红色的雾气。

487
00:25:15.070 --> 00:25:21.070
A weapon belt holds Chinese stars, boomerang, samurai sword, fencing epi.
武器带上挂着手里剑、回旋镖、武士刀和击剑重剑。

488
00:25:21.070 --> 00:25:27.070
On his head, he wears a helmet with a hole in the middle, showing his one giant eye.
他头上戴着一个中间有洞的头盔，露出他那只巨大的眼睛。

489
00:25:27.630 --> 00:25:32.910
So, for this, Alicia said she researched skateboarding and hockey equipment,
所以，对于这一套，艾丽西亚说她研究了滑板和曲棍球装备，

490
00:25:32.910 --> 00:25:34.850
as well as lacrosse equipment,
还有长曲棍球装备，

491
00:25:34.850 --> 00:25:41.270
because she wanted the whole thing to have sort of like a subterfuge ops sort of feel.
因为她想让整套装备有一种秘密行动的感觉。

492
00:25:42.030 --> 00:25:48.650
So, she said they gathered everything, and she didn't want to force Rain to like try on all this equipment.
她说他们收集了所有东西，她不想强迫雷恩去试穿所有这些装备。

493
00:25:48.710 --> 00:25:51.430
So, Alicia put it on herself.
所以，艾丽西亚自己穿上了。

494
00:25:51.690 --> 00:25:51.990
Oh.
哦。

495
00:25:52.230 --> 00:25:54.510
And she sent me a picture of herself.
她还给我发了一张她自己的照片。

496
00:25:54.750 --> 00:25:55.470
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

497
00:25:55.470 --> 00:26:02.790
And they built this costume onto Alicia, and then once they got it approved, they put it onto Rain.
他们把这套服装穿在艾丽西亚身上制作，一旦获得批准，他们就把它穿到了雷恩身上。

498
00:26:03.110 --> 00:26:08.950
And she also said there was like a lot of back and forth about what the LED box should say.
她还说，关于LED显示屏上应该写什么，他们反复讨论了很久。

499
00:26:09.290 --> 00:26:12.570
And then they finally settled on kill.
最后他们决定写上“杀”。

500
00:26:13.230 --> 00:26:19.570
And that is how Recyclops evolved and ultimately came to be.
这就是“回收怪人”如何演变并最终成型的过程。

501
00:26:19.570 --> 00:26:27.270
And thank you, Alicia, for digging through all of your digital clutter and sending us those amazing sketches.
还有谢谢你，艾丽西亚，翻遍了你所有的数字杂物，给我们发来了那些精彩的草图。

502
00:26:27.270 --> 00:26:29.550
We're going to post them in PodStories.
我们会把它们发布在 PodStories 里。

503
00:26:29.830 --> 00:26:31.270
Yes, they're so beautiful.
是的，它们太美了。

504
00:26:31.590 --> 00:26:37.630
Like, you really see what a just amazing sketch artist she is as well as being this, you know,
真的，你不仅能看出她是一位多么了不起的素描艺术家，而且她还是……你知道的，

505
00:26:37.750 --> 00:26:40.090
my gosh, she can sew and sketch and do everything.
天哪，她既会缝纫又会素描，什么都会。

506
00:26:41.010 --> 00:26:45.490
I did notice, Jenna, in the very first shooting draft for this episode,
珍娜，我确实注意到，在这一集的最初拍摄剧本里，

507
00:26:45.490 --> 00:26:48.750
this is what it said about this whole cold open.
关于整个开场戏，它是这样写的。

508
00:26:48.750 --> 00:26:50.350
Very first shooting draft.
最初的拍摄剧本。

509
00:26:51.110 --> 00:26:52.030
Cold open.
开场戏。

510
00:26:52.710 --> 00:26:53.430
To come.
待定。

511
00:26:53.730 --> 00:26:54.330
Semicolon.
分号。

512
00:26:54.650 --> 00:26:55.250
Recyclops!
回收怪人！

513
00:26:55.410 --> 00:26:56.550
Five exclamation points.
五个感叹号。

514
00:26:56.870 --> 00:26:57.970
End of cold open.
开场戏结束。

515
00:26:58.530 --> 00:26:59.770
That's all it said.
上面就写了这些。

516
00:27:00.030 --> 00:27:03.530
Yeah, you know, when I was talking to Justin about the Jim Ryan storyline,
是啊，你知道，当我和贾斯汀谈到吉姆和瑞安的故事线时，

517
00:27:03.550 --> 00:27:05.890
he said this episode really came in pieces.
他说这一集真的是拼凑出来的。

518
00:27:06.290 --> 00:27:08.790
That Recyclops was added a little later.
回收怪人是后来才加进去的。

519
00:27:09.190 --> 00:27:13.270
We did ultimately shoot Recyclops while shooting this episode.
我们最终确实是在拍摄这一集的时候拍了回收怪人的戏份。

520
00:27:13.270 --> 00:27:17.610
But, yeah, this one was, you know, bits and pieces.
但是，没错，这一集确实是，你知道的，东拼西凑的。

521
00:27:17.830 --> 00:27:18.550
Bits and pieces.
东拼西凑。

522
00:27:19.230 --> 00:27:23.650
Well, before we end the cold open, I just had a really random thought.
好吧，在结束开场戏之前，我突然冒出一个非常随机的想法。

