00:29:33.070 --> 00:29:40.590
At 3 minutes, 28 seconds, please note the superb on-screen DMI stock page.
在3分28秒时，请注意屏幕上那个精美的DMI股票页面。

578
00:29:40.730 --> 00:29:42.370
You know, it's the one Oscar's looking at.
你知道的，就是奥斯卡正在看的那个。

