00:30:06.590 --> 00:30:10.050
Well, Aaron is going to announce that Michael's limo has arrived.
他的豪华轿车。

591
00:30:10.910 --> 00:30:11.750
His limo.
不，不，不。

592
00:30:11.890 --> 00:30:12.590
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

593
00:30:12.590 --> 00:30:12.950
No, no, no.
那是辆城市轿车。

594
00:30:13.010 --> 00:30:13.610
It's a town car.
她说，我敢肯定那是辆豪华轿车。

595
00:30:14.110 --> 00:30:16.290
She's like, I'm pretty sure it's a limo.
大家都跑去外面看。

596
00:30:16.850 --> 00:30:18.410
Everyone goes and looks outside.
确实是。

597
00:30:18.750 --> 00:30:19.770
It sure is.
他们派来了一辆加长豪华轿车。

598
00:30:19.910 --> 00:30:21.370
They sent a stretch limo.
大家都印象深刻，除了奥斯卡，他又一次觉得，这很邓德·米夫林。

599
00:30:22.110 --> 00:30:26.730
Everyone is super impressed, but Oscar, who once again is like, this is classic Dunder
邓德·米夫林。

600
00:30:26.730 --> 00:30:27.130
Mifflin.
邓德·米夫林。

601
00:30:27.250 --> 00:30:30.190
They don't have the money, and they're just throwing it out there like that.
他们根本没钱，却在那儿随口乱说。

602
00:30:30.950 --> 00:30:36.010
This, of course, oh, Jenna, led me to bigcars.com.
当然，噢，珍娜，这把我引向了 bigcars.com。

603
00:30:37.490 --> 00:30:39.030
Oh, bigcars.com?
噢，bigcars.com？

604
00:30:39.110 --> 00:30:39.610
Yeah, it did.
